    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know the numbers, thanks. but they dont get it. it’s not just being sad. it’s like... i can see the blueprint. if my whole lineage is built this way, then any \"help\" is just fighting against physics. how can you fix something that's literally part of my code?",
